variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(112218.051149611+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(112218.051149611+-111881.288872011)
